00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.360
So one of the things that
we pride ourselves on

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.320
is providing apps and
services via Citrix Cloud that

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:41.020
help our enterprise
customers with their digital

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.850
