like the AutoCAD suite.

00:40:16.143 --> 00:40:17.560
And the way they'd
been doing that

00:40:17.560 --> 00:40:20.110
traditionally is by investing
in these big monstrous

00:40:20.110 --> 00:40:21.550
workstations.

00:40:21.550 --> 00:40:24.670
And they put these workstations
onto these mobile carts

00:40:24.670 --> 00:40:27.130
that they would roll
around room to room.

00:40:27.130 --> 00:40:29.860
And then as they would
have x number of students,

00:40:29.860 --> 00:40:31.300
they'd roll the
carts into a room,

00:40:31.300 --> 00:40:33.970
fire those things up,
and do their thing.

00:40:33.970 --> 00:40:36.430
Well, half the time those
things ended up just

00:40:36.430 --> 00:40:39.010
